            </div>
            <div class="section-body">
                <div class="warn-box">Works on any Linux: Proxmox, Debian, Ubuntu, Kali, etc. Use when a NIC shows DOWN or no IP assigned — common after hardware swaps or moving drives to a new motherboard.</div>

                <div class="cmd-block">
                    <div class="cmd-label">Check NIC Status</div>
                    <pre><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCode(this)">copy</button><span class="comment"># Show all network interfaces and their state</span>
ip a

<span class="comment"># Quick view — interface names and UP/DOWN state</span>
